/T (Slow Wave Sleep \(aka SWS, N3, Deep Sleep\): In addition to a steady decline with age, there are 2 accelerated drop offs. Firstly, during your teens going into your 20s and again in your 60's going into your 70s. Deep sleep declines most significantly across lifespan.)
/E (Slow Wave Sleep \(aka SWS, N3, Deep Sleep\): In addition to a steady decline with age, there are 2 accelerated drop offs. Firstly, during your teens going into your 20s and again in your 60's going into your 70s. Deep sleep declines most significantly across lifespan.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
